Activate the right agent skills per project, unambiguously.

Usage: unam [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  source  Manage skill sources
  search  Search skills across sources
  show    Show one skill: metadata, supporting files, absolute path
  bundle  Manage skill bundles
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --json        Print one JSON object on stdout
      --no-cache    Neither read nor write the catalog cache
  -v, --verbose...  More log output on stderr (repeatable)
  -q, --quiet       Less output: errors only in logs, no notes
  -h, --help        Print help
  -V, --version     Print version

status arrives in a later milestone
